# Nothing enters the CI image unless it is listed here. Build output, editor and tool state,
# local notes and logs stay out, whatever they are called. `.git` is kept: the threat model asks
# reporters to quote `git -C /src rev-parse HEAD` from inside the container.
# A new top-level entry that the build or the tests need must be added below.
*
!.cargo
!.git
!.gitattributes
!.gitignore
!.github
!Cargo.lock
!Cargo.toml
!LICENSE
!rust-toolchain.toml
!assets
!ci
!crates
!design
!kernel
!loader
!tools
!userspace
!vendor
!*.md
# Local files that .gitignore also keeps out, at any depth inside the listed directories
**/NO-COMMIT*
**/target
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
**/*.rs.bk
